# Testing scope for agents

Do **not** run end-to-end tests or the full unit/feature suite unless the user explicitly asks.

## Disallowed by default

- `npm run test:e2e` / Playwright / any e2e suite
- `npm test` / `vitest run` with no filter (full suite)
- `npm run lint` or `npm run build` as a stand-in for “verify everything” unless the user asked for CI/full verification

## Allowed

- Targeted tests for the feature or files you changed, e.g.:
  - `npx vitest run tests/feature/cart-service.test.ts`
  - `npx vitest run tests/unit/validators/product.create.test.ts`
  - a narrow vitest path/name filter that matches only related specs

## When in doubt

- Prefer **no tests** over a full run.
- Only expand to more files if those tests clearly cover the same change.
- Full suite / e2e only when the user says so (e.g. “run all tests”, “run e2e”, “run CI”).
